  PDFRender - RISC OS render backend interface (module side only;
  not part of the host build).

  Renders into a caller-supplied 32bpp sprite by redirecting VDU
  output (OS_SpriteOp 60) and then driving the OS renderers:
  Draw module for paths, FontManager for anti-aliased text,
  OS_SpriteOp 52 for decoded images and SpriteExtend's
